        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そんなこと言ってる場合か！\nせーので引っ張るぞ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "source_text": "せーの！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いやぁ、危ないところだったッスね。\nでも……うん、ケガはないみたいで何よりッス！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ん？　この崖……高さは2メートルもないな。\n茂みで見えにくいけど、すぐそこが地面だ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "す、すみません。急なハプニングだったので、\n気が動転したみたいです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あ、本当だ。ちょっと足を伸ばせば、\n地面に着くような崖だったんですね。あはは……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "とんだ人騒がせじゃねーか。このノロマ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おい。プロデューサーはオマエのために、\nこんな山まで来てくれたんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。タケルの言う通りだ。\n漣、師匠に言うことはないのか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……オマエみたいな弱いヤツが勝手にうろつくから、\nあんなことになるんだろーが。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すみません、●●●●●●●●●●師匠。\n漣は素直じゃないッスから……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いえ……そんなことより私は今、\n皆さんが力を合わせてくれたことが嬉しくて……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_h:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ハァ？　オマエ……何言ってんだよ、バァーカ！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
